cise that code without a live Couchbase server, mirroring the \\n...[truncated]\",\n        \"scope\": \"testImplementation\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"input_evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"issue\",\n        \"summary\": \"#9746 Support for org.springframework.data:spring-data-couchbase:6.1.1; label=library-new-request; body_chars=39\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n        \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"input_tokens_used\": 50,\n    \"issue_label\": \"library-new-request\",\n    \"issue_number\": 9746,\n    \"library\": \"org.springframework.data:spring-data-couchbase:6.1.1\",\n    \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n    \"output_tokens_used\": 26745,\n    \"risks\": [\n      \"If generation reaches for a live Couchbase connection or Testcontainers instead of mocking CouchbaseOperations, it will stall or fail in CI since no Couchbase Docker image is allow-listed in this repo.\",\n      \"The pinned mockito-core version is from training knowledge, not network-verified against Maven Central; if resolution fails, local Gradle verification will surface it for correction.\"\n    ],\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"summary\": \"Core module behind the already-merged spring-boot-data-couchbase:4.1.1; mapping/conversion/annotation-processing coverage is reachable without a live Couchbase cluster (same boundary that module's tests already proved out), but repository-proxy and query-derivation coverage needs a mocked CouchbaseOperations since no Couchbase Docker image is pinned in this repo.\"\n  },\n  \"libraryUpdateRoute\": null,\n  \"newVersion\": null,\n  \"phases\": {\n    \"explore\": {\n      \"chunkClassCount\": null,\n      \"chunkProcessedClassCount\": 0,\n      \"exhaustedClasses\": [],\n      \"iteration\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    \"finalization\": {\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    \"fix\": {\n      \"iteration\": null,\n      \"status\": \"skipped\