rg.springframework.data:spring-data-couchbase:6.1.1/native-test-verify/pi-generation-2026-10-04T15-40-48-394957Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n- Remove or rewrite `readsClassValuedDocumentProperties()` so it does not require runtime-generated CGLIB classes; do not add unrelated metadata.\n- Regenerate the dynamic-access report and run the coordinate test, confirming coverage remains `25/25` and `nativeTest` passes.\n- Commit the correction to the preserved branch and resume finalization, ensuring the reporter-requested step does not restore the unsupported test.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d555359173491b7016ac276b9b71887d184f101e675ddc2b8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 4605, "output": 1515, "cacheRead": 200960, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 207080, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791129245068, "responseId": "resp_0d555359173491b7016ac2769ed1cc87d184ee0b91457f22b9", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
